{"id":"n89445-9-2","stage":0,"title":"알다 · 懂","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n89445-9-2-1","ko":"오늘은 가족 행사가 있으니 저녁에 일찍 오너라.","zh":"今天有家庭聚会，晚上早点回来哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘은","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가족","meaning":"家庭，家人","explanation":"가족：家庭，家人","readings":[{"term":"가족","audio":"/audio/7659575fd72a872b8d05.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44487","senseId":"1","lemma":"가족","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"행사가","meaning":"活动，仪式，典礼","explanation":"행사：活动，仪式，典礼；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"행사","audio":"/audio/9fbe110d36cda8cf2d98.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72482","senseId":"1","lemma":"행사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있으니","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；으니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저녁에","meaning":"傍晚","explanation":"저녁：傍晚；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"저녁","audio":"/audio/8d3c547011f433e6d259.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71220","senseId":"1","lemma":"저녁","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일찍","meaning":"早早儿","explanation":"일찍：早早儿","readings":[{"term":"일찍","audio":"/audio/6b45c134c531ab187881.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26226","senseId":"1","lemma":"일찍","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오너라.","meaning":"来，来参加","explanation":"오다：来，来参加；너라：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"12","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"7659575fd72a872b","term":"가족","zh":"家庭，家人","audio":"/audio/7659575fd72a872b8d05.mp3","entryId":"44487","definition":"主要指聚在一起生活，由婚姻、父母、子女、兄弟等的关系构成的社会单位；或指其成员。","pronunciation":["가족"]},{"id":"9fbe110d36cda8cf","term":"행사","zh":"活动，仪式，典礼","audio":"/audio/9fbe110d36cda8cf2d98.mp3","entryId":"72482","definition":"有目的或计划地按程序做某事；或指该事。","pronunciation":["행사"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"事实或现象存在。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"8d3c547011f433e6","term":"저녁","zh":"傍晚","audio":"/audio/8d3c547011f433e6d259.mp3","entryId":"71220","definition":"从太阳落山开始到晚上的时间。","pronunciation":["저녁"]},{"id":"6b45c134c531ab18","term":"일찍","zh":"早早儿","audio":"/audio/6b45c134c531ab187881.mp3","entryId":"26226","definition":"比指定时间早地。","pronunciation":["일찍"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来参加","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了参与某个有目的性的聚会而从另一个地方转移到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/95824dfd54ecf5a2bd60.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n89445-9-2-2","ko":"네, 엄마. 알겠어요.","zh":"好的，妈妈，我知道了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"엄마.","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"알겠어요.","meaning":"懂，明白","explanation":"알다：懂，明白；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"9","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"懂，明白","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"对于对方的某个命令或请求，同意听从。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6966cdb8bc227935d130.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.58,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=89445","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"9","sourceLevel":"초급","day":11,"sequenceScore":0.3916,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["今天有家庭聚会，晚上早点回来哦。","好的，妈妈，我知道了。","愿意和我一起跳舞吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["今天有家庭聚会，晚上早点回来哦。","好的，妈妈，我知道了。","愿意和我一起跳舞吗？"],"answer":1}]}
